# Repository-wide ignores. Each project also has its own .gitignore for the
# things specific to it; this file only covers what sits at the workspace root.

# --- Deliberately not versioned -----------------------------------------------

# BAL precompute experiment. Holds ~10.6 GB of downloaded and generated data -
# the national G-NAF archive, its extracted address database, the NSW
# OpenStreetMap extract, and per-council BAL output. A stray `git add -A` would
# try to commit all of it and the push would be rejected.
#
# To version the code inside it later, either narrow this rule or force-add the
# specific files: git add -f embercheck-bal-precompute-demo/scripts
embercheck-bal-precompute-demo/

# Working notes, not part of any application.
docs/

